msgstr "L'indirizzo del tuo booking engine Slope, così com'è: https://booking.slope.it/0a1b2c3d-4e5f-6a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d"

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-slope.php:179
msgid "Slope receives the number of children only: their ages are asked on the booking engine."
msgstr "Slope riceve solo il numero dei bambini: le età le chiede il booking engine."

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-synxis.php:24
msgid "The number after hotel= in the booking engine address: https://be.synxis.com/?hotel=<hotel>&chain=<chain>"
msgstr "Il numero dopo hotel= nell'indirizzo del booking engine: https://be.synxis.com/?hotel=<hotel>&chain=<chain>"

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-synxis.php:40
msgid "chain"
msgstr "chain"

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-synxis.php:41
msgid "The number after chain= in the same address. Both codes are given by the booking engine: the whole address can be pasted in either field."
msgstr "Il numero dopo chain= nello stesso indirizzo. Entrambi i codici li fornisce il booking engine: in ognuno dei due campi si può incollare l'indirizzo intero."

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-synxis.php:312
msgid "Enable it to send the age of each child: without the ages SynXis asks the guests for them on its own page."
msgstr "Da attivare per inviare l'età di ogni bambino: senza le età SynXis le chiede agli ospiti nella propria pagina."

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-thinkreservations.php:24
msgid "The address of your ThinkReservations booking engine, as it is: https://secure.thinkreservations.com/myproperty/reservations"
msgstr "L'indirizzo del tuo booking engine ThinkReservations, così com'è: https://secure.thinkreservations.com/myproperty/reservations"

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-windsurfer.php:24
msgid "The address of your Windsurfer booking engine, as it is: https://res.windsurfercrs.com/ibe/index.aspx?propertyID=12345"
msgstr "L'indirizzo del tuo booking engine Windsurfer, così com'è: https://res.windsurfercrs.com/ibe/index.aspx?propertyID=12345"

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-windsurfer.php:179
msgid "Windsurfer receives the number of children only: their ages are asked on the booking engine."
msgstr "Windsurfer riceve solo il numero dei bambini: le età le chiede il booking engine."

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-witbooking.php:24
msgid "The address of your Witbooking booking engine, as it is: https://engine.witbooking.com/es/hotel/myhotel.com, or the one on your own domain, such as https://reservations.myhotel.com/es/hotel/myhotel. The language of the address is replaced with the one of the page."
msgstr "L'indirizzo del tuo booking engine Witbooking, così com'è: https://engine.witbooking.com/es/hotel/myhotel.com, oppure quello sul tuo dominio, per esempio https://reservations.myhotel.com/es/hotel/myhotel. La lingua dell'indirizzo viene sostituita con quella della pagina."

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-witbooking.php:42
msgid "Automatic is the right choice when the site has more than one language: the booking engine opens in the language of the page. On a site with one language only, choose a language your property has: when it does not have the one asked for, the booking engine opens in its own."
msgstr "Automatica è la scelta giusta quando il sito ha più di una lingua: il booking engine si apre nella lingua della pagina. Su un sito in una lingua sola, scegli una lingua che la tua struttura ha: quando non ha quella richiesta, il booking engine si apre nella propria."

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-witbooking.php:200
msgid "Enable Children only if your property accepts them: the age ranges are the ones configured in your Witbooking booking engine."
msgstr "Abilita Bambini solo se la tua struttura li accetta: le fasce di età sono quelle impostate nel tuo booking engine Witbooking."

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-witbooking.php:289
msgid "Enable Infants only if your property accepts them: the age ranges are the ones configured in your Witbooking booking engine."
msgstr "Abilita Neonati solo se la tua struttura li accetta: le fasce di età sono quelle impostate nel tuo booking engine Witbooking."

